    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d534-a15">

                <pb facs="0520" n="422" sameAs="frus:frus1900/pg422"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 6.—Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister of Foreign Affairs to Mr.
                    Swenson.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Copenhagen</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1900-03-13"><hi rendition="#italic">March 13,
                        1900</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Mr. Minister</hi>: In your note of the 7th instant
                    you request my intervention for the purpose of obtaining for Mr. Thomas P.
                    Jensen, a Mormon missionary against whom a decree of expulsion has been issued,
                    permission to remain in Denmark until April 12.</p>
                <p>In reply I have the honor to inform you that my colleague, the minister of
                    justice, consents to Mr. Jensen’s postponing his departure to the above
                    date.</p>
                <p>I avail myself, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">N. F. Ravn.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
